        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange rumor has been spreading in this quiet countryside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that if you walk alone at night,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a ghostly woman will speak to you—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Are you ■■■?”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple survival horror set in a hilly town where you must escape from a ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on running away—there are no puzzles, item usage, or complex controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, try again, memorize the roads, and find your way to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes to over 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep clicking on Ayumu’s apartment mailbox and…!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For details, please check the official STUDIO DYD website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any resemblance to actual persons, organizations, or places is purely coincidental.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
